Name=Captain America v3
Description=v3 (mana base): v2 with 34 lands instead of 32. Removed Boros Garrison, Buried Ruin, Slayers' Stronghold, Sunken Citadel, Temple of Triumph, Temple of the False God, Uncharted Haven, Uthros and 8 basics; added 18 mostly-untapped Jeskai lands (each roughly under $10). Cut Gilgamesh and Selfless Squire to make room.
